            "title": "Naming",
            "id": 127527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Analogamente alla denominazione di variabili e funzioni, esistono alcune pratiche comuni per la definizione delle classi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" teacher = \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"150\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Person</code>, seguito da <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Class name",
            "id": 127528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi delle classi di solito hanno la prima lettera maiuscola e le altre minuscole, come nel caso di <code>Person</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Descriptive",
            "id": 127529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per le variabili, cerchiamo di dare alle classi nomi descrittivi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" author: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", title: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"B\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>class</code>, seguito da <code>Book</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Consistent",
            "id": 127530,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come per la denominazione di variabili e funzioni, dovremmo dare nomi coerenti alle cose e fare attenzione alle maiuscole.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" teacher = \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"267\" endIndex=\"273\" /><option startIndex=\"273\" endIndex=\"274\" /><option startIndex=\"274\" endIndex=\"275\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Saybye\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sayBye</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Other features",
            "id": 127531,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come i metodi al di fuori delle classi, puoi usare le funzioni integrate di Swift e le funzionalità principali.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flavor: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients: [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(flavor: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", ingredients: [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"printIngredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredient \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients {    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(ingredient)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" applePie = \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"(flavor: \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", ingredients: [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apples&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.printIngredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"207\" endIndex=\"210\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"221\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"224\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>ingredient</code> e infine <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>"
